--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: GameContent_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9cd26e346f898dc44847ddc8f15f6731, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 65954802835456
    m_Localized: Discover how Mark escaped the island.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 65954807029760
    m_Localized: Workshop
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 65954807029761
    m_Localized: "This place is an island surrounded by frigid waters year-round.
      There are no bridges; the only way off is the armed patrol ferry. The Devil\u2019s
      Prison\u2014all that awaits its inmates is a lifetime behind bars. Yet yesterday,
      the prison alarms rang all night. My cellmate, Mark, dug through the ventilation
      shaft and escaped, leaving nothing on his bed but a crude dummy."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 65954807029762
    m_Localized: Mark fitted a drill with the motor and broke through the ventilation
      shaft. He sharpened a spoon to shape an oar, used steam to bond rubber raincoats
      into a raft and life jacket, converted the accordion into a pump to inflate
      the raft, and finally sailed away.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 65954811224064
    m_Localized: "Uncover the truth behind the police officer\u2019s death."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 65954811224065
    m_Localized: Inn Bar
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 65954811224066
    m_Localized: "After leaving the prison, we stopped at an inn. By \u201Cwe,\u201D
      I mean myself and the police officer assigned to me\u2014a young man far too
      straitlaced for his age. By evening, thick fog had swallowed the town, turning
      the inn into yet another island. I lingered at the bar for ages, but the young
      officer never offered me a drink. He did not even respond to the barmaid\u2019s
      repeated attempts to charm him. Just as boredom drove me toward bed, a scream
      came from outside. The young officer lay on the ground, his heart already still,
      with no footprints around him but our own."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 65954811224067
    m_Localized: The officer was taking anti-inflammatory medicine for an infected
      wisdom tooth. The barmaid replaced his drink with alcohol, and the interaction
      poisoned him. Dizzy, he left the inn, collapsed, and died. The heavy fog and
      moisture concealed the footprints at the scene.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 65954811224068
    m_Localized: Uncover the truth behind the moving demon.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 65954811224069
    m_Localized: "Chapel at the Count\u2019s Estate"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 65954811224070
    m_Localized: "My success in solving the case caught the attention of a noblewoman
      who happened to be stranded there. Once the fog lifted, she invited me to stay
      at her estate. Though, as a prisoner, I should not be wandering around without
      a police escort, I accepted in hopes of finding Mark\u2014and defeating the
      demon\u2014sooner. Of course, things were not so simple. On my first night
      at the estate, a scream rang out in the dead of night. The noblewoman\u2019s
      daughter claimed she had seen the demon in the painting move. Objective: uncover
      the truth behind the moving demon."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 65954811224071
    m_Localized: "The count\u2019s family decided to sell the painting. The appraiser,
      who truly loved it, planned to steal it in secret and replace it with a forgery.
      When the count\u2019s daughter came downstairs in the middle of the night,
      the appraiser had to hang the painting in the wrong place to avoid being discovered,
      making her think the demon inside it had moved."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 65954811224072
    m_Localized: Vacuum Cleaner
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 65954811224073
    m_Localized: A broken vacuum cleaner. Opening it reveals that the motor is missing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 65954811224074
    m_Localized: Steam Pipe
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 65954811224075
    m_Localized: Is that a rubber raincoat stuck to it? It has melted completely.
      What a pungent smell.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 65954811224076
    m_Localized: Barred Window
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 65954811224077
    m_Localized: The sea stays frigid all year, and the waves are vicious. Anyone
      who tries to swim will freeze to death without question, though every year
      some fool still tries.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 65954811224078
    m_Localized: Accordion
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 65954811224079
    m_Localized: "An accordion that is out of tune. Ha, how nostalgic. Perhaps I\u2019ll
      give a solo performance at the next gathering."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 65954811224080
    m_Localized: Spoon
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 65954811224081
    m_Localized: A stolen spoon with one edge ground into a blade. Sharp and dangerous.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 65954811224082
    m_Localized: Medical Record in His Pocket
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 65954811224083
    m_Localized: "Infected wisdom tooth. Take as directed by the doctor\u2026 The
      rest is illegible. Ha, no wonder he talks as little as I do."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 65954811224084
    m_Localized: White Powder
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 65954811224085
    m_Localized: White powder scattered across the bar. I dabbed some on my finger
      and tasted it. Strange flavor. It seems they were not making a salt-rimmed
      margarita.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 65954811224086
    m_Localized: Wine Glass
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 65954811224087
    m_Localized: "Pink liquid remains in the glass. Vodka, and\u2026 a very strong
      fruit aroma."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 65954811224088
    m_Localized: Window
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 65954811224089
    m_Localized: The thick fog hides everything, and the air is damp and clammy.
      We are trapped here. No one will come until the fog lifts. Is that a good thing
      or a bad thing?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 65954811224090
    m_Localized: Pistol
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 65954811224091
    m_Localized: A symbol of police authority. I checked the rifling and magazine;
      there is no sign it has been fired. Even so, under the circumstances, it is
      best to leave it where everyone can see it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 65954811224092
    m_Localized: Appraisal Certificate
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 65954811224093
    m_Localized: "The appraisal concludes that this piece is an original. It was
      issued by the appraiser recently staying at the count\u2019s estate, who knows
      a great deal about the artist."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 65954811224094
    m_Localized: The Temptation of Saint Anthony
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 65954811224095
    m_Localized: "A famous sixteenth-century painting by Bosch. It is a hinged triptych
      altarpiece divided into a central panel, left wing, and right wing, each enormous
      in size\u2026 Shh, I\u2019m only reading what the appraisal says."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 65954811224096
    m_Localized: "Portrait of the Duke\u2019s Family"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 65954811224097
    m_Localized: "Compared with the count\u2019s estate as it is now, quite a few
      things are missing. Perhaps the family is not as wealthy as I imagined."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 65954811224098
    m_Localized: Fishing-Tackle Bucket
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 65954811224099
    m_Localized: "A bucket of fishing gear by the door, oddly out of place among
      the estate\u2019s other furnishings. Perhaps someone in the count\u2019s family
      is an avid angler."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 65954811224100
    m_Localized: Trolley
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 65954811224101
    m_Localized: "A multi-section flashlight, a handheld magnifying glass, a small
      polarizing lens\u2014and several other things I do not recognize. Such an impressive
      collection of appraisal tools that their owner needed a trolley to carry them."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 65954811224102
    m_Localized: Brute Force
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 65954811224103
    m_Localized: Swim for It
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 65954811224104
    m_Localized: Ride the Wind and Waves
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 65954811224105
    m_Localized: Drink Poison to Quench Thirst
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 65954811224106
    m_Localized: Drink to Excess
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 65954811224107
    m_Localized: Bitter Medicine
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 65954811224108
    m_Localized: Jump at Shadows
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 65954811224109
    m_Localized: Sell the Family Fortune
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 65954811224110
    m_Localized: Swap the Real for the Fake
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 65954811224111
    m_Localized: "I can\u2019t wait to see what kind of farce you\u2019ll stage this
      time."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 65954811224112
    m_Localized: "You\u2019re playing with fire, darling. How long do you think your
      luck will last?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 65954811224113
    m_Localized: "Ha, the way you struggle is truly touching\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 65954811224114
    m_Localized: "You\u2019ll regret this. You\u2019ll regret it very, very much.
      I promise."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 65954811224115
    m_Localized: "You\u2019re right. It\u2019s time we had some fun."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 65954811224116
    m_Localized: "Very well. There\u2019s no harm in giving you a tiny reward now
      and then."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 65954811224117
    m_Localized: "There\u2019s still time to surrender. Don\u2019t worry\u2014I like
      people who know when they\u2019re beaten."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 65954811224118
    m_Localized: "You think it\u2019s over? No, baby. Those nightmares will never
      leave you. They\u2019ll be like restless bones, creaking without end\u2014haunting
      you, tormenting you, forever and ever\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 65954811224119
    m_Localized: "Shabby scenery, hopeless supporting players\u2014how is our hero
      supposed to shine on a stage like this?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 65954811224120
    m_Localized: "Don\u2019t celebrate too soon. We have a long road ahead of us."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 65954811224121
    m_Localized: "Don\u2019t blame me, darling. You brought this suffering on yourself."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 65954811224122
    m_Localized: "Heh. You can\u2019t escape. Fate\u2019s rope is already tightening
      around your throat. All your efforts are in vain. In the end, we\u2019ll meet
      again in hell\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 65954811224123
    m_Localized: "Oh, darling, you don\u2019t like dreaming. I know. Shh, shh, shh.
      Don\u2019t worry, there\u2019s nothing here\u2014no wrongfully condemned prisoners,
      no endless lights of the tribunal\u2026 only darkness. Dark\u2014ness\u2014warm
      and damp. Do you remember now? The smell of thawing earth, the prick of straw
      against your face. That\u2019s right: the old barn in Kuwait County!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 65954811224124
    m_Localized: "You\u2019ve come too far, baby. This journey has worn you out.
      Now it\u2019s time to go home."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 65954811224125
    m_Localized: "No, no, we can\u2019t wait any longer. We must leave now, before
      the apple trees bloom this year\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 65954811224126
    m_Localized: "Then tell me: what exactly are you waiting for? Justice that doesn\u2019t
      exist? Forgiveness that will never come? Or are you waiting for\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 65954811224127
    m_Localized: Aha, what a daring idea. In that respect, you and I are rather alike.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 65954811224128
    m_Localized: "But you know every bargain has its price. Five statements\u2014each
      time, you may speak only four. If your sweet truth has not surrendered within
      those four statements, you die, baby."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 65954811224129
    m_Localized: "Let me give you a word of advice. This is a perilous road with
      no return, and you, darling, are an empty-handed gambler who must stake everything.
      Soul, flesh\u2014hehehehe\u2026 I\u2019ll do everything in my power to make
      you lose. Oh, what am I saying? Of course you have those things."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 65954811224130
    m_Localized: Made up your mind? Heh, how decisive. Sign your name here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 65954811224131
    m_Localized: 'Time Curse: Fewer Statements'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 65954811224132
    m_Localized: "I can see the countdown on your life ticking down. Let me speed
      it up\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 65954811224133
    m_Localized: Click and drag the highlighted item into the speaking slot to see what it reveals.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
